            "text": "Do you know what's south of here?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Do you know what's south of here?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "No. We sent a scouting party in that direction, when we first established our camp. Some of the men got lost in the swamps. Eventually we listed them as dead."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Then suddenly they returned, with a wild gleam in their eyes, raving about gods and snakes and all kinds of madness."
              },
              {
                "npc": "We had to drive them out, in case their condition infected the rest of the troops. Their wives will be given a full widow pension when we return home."
              },
              {
                "npc": "General Hining concluded that, whatever is down there, it's not affiliated with any of the elf factions, and it should be left alone."
              },
              {
                "player": "Thank you."
